WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.970
Your phone's AI can now read your screen.

2
00:00:02.315 --> 00:00:03.990
Signal just started blocking it.

3
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.660
On iPhone, it blocks screenshots, so Siri can't read along.

4
00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:12.010
On Android, when it spots an AI peeking, the AI gets a black screen.

5
00:00:12.485 --> 00:00:14.830
Signal calls this an existential threat.

6
00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.980
And it admits the fix has holes.

7
00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:18.520
It can't do this on a Mac,

8
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:21.310
and an AI could still read files already on your phone.

9
00:00:21.775 --> 00:00:22.840
You can switch it off.

10
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.610
But then, Signal warns, your friends' messages are exposed too.

11
00:00:27.215 --> 00:00:28.610
So who gets the final say?

12
00:00:28.865 --> 00:00:30.860
Your AI, or the friend texting you?

